    <div class="container">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> February 2026</p>

    <p>
        PDF Hive ("we", "our", or "us") respects your privacy. 
        This Privacy Policy explains how our mobile application operates and how user information is handled.
        By using the application, you agree to this Privacy Policy.
    </p>

    <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>
        PDF Hive does <strong>not require user registration</strong> and does not collect direct personal information 
        such as your name, email address, or phone number.
    </p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Documents:</strong> Files are stored locally on your device. We do not transmit files to our servers.</li>
        <li><strong>Service Providers:</strong> We use third-party tools (Google Firebase and AdMob) that may collect certain information automatically to provide app functionality.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>2. Third-Party Services & Analytics</h2>
    <p>
        To improve app performance and manage features, we use the following services:
    </p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Firebase Remote Config:</strong> We use this to manage app settings and features remotely. This service may collect anonymous installation identifiers to apply configurations to your device.</li>
        <li><strong>Google AdMob:</strong> Our app includes the AdMob SDK. While ads may not be active currently, the SDK may collect device identifiers (like Android Advertising ID) to prepare for future ad delivery or basic frequency capping.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Local Storage</h2>
    <p>
        All documents and folders created within PDF Hive are stored exclusively on your device. 
        We do not access, upload, or share your files. You are responsible for backing up your own data, as no cloud backup is provided.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Data Security</h2>
    <p>
        Because files remain on your device, security depends on your device’s protection. 
        We recommend using screen locks and encryption to keep your data safe.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Contact Us</h2>
    <p>
        If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy, contact us at: 
        <strong>info.reynrel@gmail.com</strong>
    </p>

    <footer>
        © 2026 PDF Hive. All Rights Reserved.
    </footer>
